# One kept view for display: its thumbnail and how the calibration fits its corners.

# 0-based view index.
uint32 index
---
bool found

# What the detector saw (after preprocessing), downscaled.
sensor_msgs/CompressedImage thumbnail

# Size of the full image the points refer to.
uint32 image_width
uint32 image_height

# Detected corners, x and y interleaved, px.
float32[] image_points

# Detected minus projected corner positions, x and y interleaved, px: in the final calibration,
# or for a removed view in its leave-one-out prediction. Empty without a final pass.
float32[] residuals
